{"ref":"BDB, תְּמוּנָה","hw":"תְּמוּנָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמוּנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. likeness, form</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:4\" href=\"/Exodus.20.4\">Ex 20:4</a> + 4 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמוּנַת (תְּמֻנַת)</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.16\">Dt 4:16</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמוּנָתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:15\" href=\"/Psalms.17.15\">ψ 17:15</a>;—<em>likeness, representation</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּסֶל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:4\" href=\"/Exodus.20.4\">Ex 20:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.8\">Dt 5:8</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.16\">4:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.25\">25</a>; <em>form, semblance</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:8\" href=\"/Numbers.12.8\">Nu 12:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:15\" href=\"/Psalms.17.15\">ψ 17:15</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.12\">Dt 4:12</a> (vid. Dr), v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.15\">15</a>; of nocturnal apparition <a data-ref=\"Job 4:16\" href=\"/Job.4.16\">Jb 4:16</a>.","next":"BDB, מֵינֶ֫קֶת","prev":"BDB, מִין"}